SUMMARY:[Natural Language Processing & LLMs][Machine Learning] EACL 2027 - 
 ARR long and short paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference of the European Chapter of the Ass
 ociation for Computational Linguistics\nWebsite: https://2027.eacl.org/\n
 Source URL: https://2027.eacl.org/calls/papers/\nLocation: Athens\, Greec
 e\nTopics: Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Machine Learning\, Deep R
 epresentation Learning\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: XL\nSub
 mission type: Paper-based / ACL Rolling Review\nConfidence: confirmed\nLa
 st checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Official EACL 2027 pages (rechecked 2
 026-10-28) confirm the hybrid Athens meeting\, Mar 9-14\, and 23:59 AoE d
 eadlines: ARR submission Aug 3\, commitment Oct 11\, camera-ready Nov 26.
  Notification Nov 12 is day-only (no hour published). Fresh main-track su
 bmissions are closed\; commitment applies only to ARR-reviewed papers. In
 dustry\, demo and student-workshop calls are separate.\nScope: Computatio
 nal linguistics and natural language processing\, including language mode
 ling\, multilingual processing\, translation\, dialogue\, information ext
 raction\, semantics\, and linguistic analysis. Human-centered evaluation\
 , interpretability\, and bias are relevant within language research. The 
 reviewed 2027 theme strengthens connections to psycholinguistics and cogn
 itive modeling\; peripheral application domains are not extra tags.\nAddi
 tional topics: Explainability & Interpretability\, Fairness & Responsible
  AI\, Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\nScope sources (2027): 
 https://2027.eacl.org/calls/papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://2027.eacl.org/calls/papers/
